    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Joe Putz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106007381758245624610/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJh8K-72W3-iv9enkuT1v5Hu77BYQR7Yr178uxuND6WVjV9UJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Its a tiny location.  We visited on a busy warm Friday and the ice-cream was soft. We barely made it to a nice park 1 km away by car. The blizzard was not soup yet but would no longer pass the upside down test.",
        "time": 1755955102,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emily",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107687937714783938325/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeexc8BrIgHnPHW9HLwO6zfaTZ9EKSPDcgZIJd53t4FIV21LPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I had an extremely disappointing experience today. To start, they ran out of vanilla ice cream and didn’t inform anyone waiting in line until after orders were placed. Instead of showing understanding, the staff laughed and joked about it, which felt disrespectful to paying customers. When we placed our order, not only did we receive very poor customer service, but they also gave us the wrong sizes. Even worse, the chocolate ice cream was practically liquid and the staff openly commented on how runny it was, yet still went ahead and made our Blizzards anyway.\n\nBecause the consistency was completely off, they didn’t even flip the Blizzards when handing them over, which is part of the DQ standard and should’ve meant we got them for free.\nI was so frustrated by the lack of care and professionalism that I didn’t even bother arguing, knowing it wouldn’t be taken seriously. I live just two minutes away, and sadly, this is what we were served and we can't even eat them they're soup. Really disappointed, this used to be one of our favourite treats, but after today’s visit, we won’t be coming back and I advise others to do the same.",
        "time": 1746405503,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lynne Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106068941401907570176/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGa7Oig-XzCSBF7b4P_4bSm6qqjMUnXy9g7q0_nIoXF8SlLwqg0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Picture of a medium sundae versus what I actually got for $7...not impressed...and was virtually ignored by the staff, had to get my own receipt. Do not recommend",
        "time": 1719627906,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "C V",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106649603489795523688/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVa4lkcRg6x9PYMJ-Hsewmkg_vJ4qEPiapkbWRy2QC_RLjJ4Byu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Drove over 20 minutes to come because it showed the opening hours were until 9:30 pm on Saturday. We showed up about 10-15 mins before closing time, the open sign was still illuminated yet the doors were locked and the worker that we saw inside went into the back to avoid us at the door. Poor service.",
        "time": 1705199157,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ray Ucon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108440264059225025001/reviews",
